                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\nlogsad(s)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// s = time to drop 6dB (in seconds)\n{\n\treturn\tLN2 / (s * samplerate);\n}\n\r\n// log smooth (decay) envelope follower\nlogdecay(x,\td)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// d = decay time (to drop 6dB) in seconds\n{\n\tHistory\tz(0);\n\tad\t\t= logsad(d);\n\tff\t\t= x - z;\n\ty\t\t= (ff > 0) ? x : ((ff * ad) + z);\n\tz\t\t= y;\n\treturn\ty;\n}\n\r\nout1    = logdecay(in1, in2*0.001);\r\n\r\n",
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "<Monospaced>",
